## CustomerListsApi

### Create customer lists
## Create customer lists
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "is_nca": "<string>",
 "list_type": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "records": "<string>",
 "records_v2": "<string>"
}


### Get customer list
## Get customer list
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists/{{customer_list_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get customer lists
## Get customer lists
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&excludeNca={{excludeNca}}
Accept: application/json

### Update customer list
## Update customer list
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists/{{customer_list_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "records": "<string>",
 "records_v2": "<string>"
}

